674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L5pGSfGHWIsQ7kNvwE_ZHSN&_nc_oc=AdrWqXSKluOeJUuTRu5IE6TSqyS6OHsr7TRO4MA50WWzVtjM_9lEltiDuLnQzzwu_lE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_2agRSBb3D_pamnZk6u04QmZ8zbDbDJT4vahbydXayow&oe=6A3BEA59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCo3uwNJuoMQ7kNvwGfU_gz&_nc_oc=AdrtGa_j6A7vPCqGMBBf9BOQX6gxlGaewor9-W28INOu6QcIyi8O6nLfRYXz15UZqDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_BD3SYBwARIXyFPQ8QGacYmf6YwoC29ws-rCJHCDrb1Q&oe=6A3BF316"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8m9OOaYM3OkQ7kNvwH1LNTy&_nc_oc=AdrIObf306ihd4kFgK1iosgp5zZasv_sv9eSWmCfvwmwfa2VMnAsRixcJPJjwj1J8lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_TUOV_sebCKVe2O1k4I1wDcilro_m3Ekf3PEwzc4x_eA&oe=6A3BEF31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip